    <bpmn:process id="W_W3834" name="W3834. Selling-Skills Curriculum &amp; Consultative Selling Playbook Development" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W3833); curriculum cycle
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Selling-skills curriculum &amp; playbooks
Owner: Sales Enablement / L&amp;D
Participants: Sales Enablement, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Master Associates, Trade Capability (links to VS-123)
Source: workflow W3834 — Selling-Skills Curriculum &amp; Consultative Selling Playbook Development</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3834_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3834_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3834_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3834_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3834_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3834_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3834_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3834_Start3" name="Strategy (W3833); curriculum cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3834_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3834_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/L&amp;D design the selling-skills curriculum…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/L&amp;D design the selling-skills curriculum: greeting/needs-discovery, consultative/needs-based selling, objection handling, closing, multi-tender/loyalty enrollment, cross-sell/upsell, and customer-follow-up — distinct from (and complementary to) the trade-product knowledge (links to W3842) and general L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / L&amp;D / Master Associates
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3834_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3834_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3834_Task5" name="Sales Enablement build consultative selling playbooks for BuildRight&#x27;s context…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement build consultative selling playbooks for BuildRight&#x27;s context: project-based selling (a customer building a bathroom/kitchen/extension needs a solution basket, not a single item), problem-solving selling (the customer describes a problem, the associate specifies the solution), and value/quality selling vs price-only — leveraging estimation (links to VS-09.2) and design (links to VS-66)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / In-Store Services / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3834_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3834_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3834_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/L&amp;D publish the curriculum and playbooks to the enablement/OLA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/L&amp;D publish the curriculum and playbooks to the enablement/OLA platform (links to W3839/VS-19.4), and refresh for new categories/services/promotions (links to VS-01.1/VS-14)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3834_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3834_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3834_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3834_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3834_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-601 (ensure controlled execution — Sales Enablement Strategy, Content &amp; Coaching Framework (PA-124.1).) | - operational: tailored playbooks; operational: coaching (links to W3836)
Owner: Sales Enablement / L&amp;D</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3834_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3834_Annotation8" targetRef="W3834_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3834_Flow10" sourceRef="W3834_Start3" targetRef="W3834_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3834_Flow11" sourceRef="W3834_Task4" targetRef="W3834_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3834_Flow12" sourceRef="W3834_Task5" targetRef="W3834_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3834_Flow13" sourceRef="W3834_Task6" targetRef="W3834_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
