    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3835" name="W3835. Department &amp; Category Selling Playbooks (Attachment, Linked, Project Selling)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Category strategy (links to VS-01); new product/service
Frequency: Per category + ongoing
Volume: Department/category playbooks (lumber, tiles, plumbing, electrical, paint, tools, appliances)
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising
Participants: Sales Enablement, Merchandising/Category (links to VS-01), Store Ops (links to VS-07), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), Installation (links to VS-12), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4)
Source: workflow W3835 — Department &amp; Category Selling Playbooks (Attachment, Linked, Project Selling)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3835_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3835_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3835_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3835_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3835_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3835_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3835_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3835_Start3" name="Category strategy (links to VS-01); new product/service">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3835_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3835_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Merchandising develop department/category selling playbooks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Merchandising develop department/category selling playbooks: category selling points, common customer jobs, attachment/accessory items (e.g., paint → brushes/rollers/tray/primer/sandpaper; power tool → battery/blade/accessory; tile → adhesive/grout/spacer; lumber → fasteners/finish), complementary categories, and project baskets
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Per category</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3835_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3835_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3835_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/In-Store-Services embed service attach into the playbooks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/In-Store-Services embed service attach into the playbooks: fabrication (cut-to-length, pipe threading — links to VS-09.1), paint tinting (links to W898), estimation (links to VS-09.2), installation (links to VS-12), delivery (links to VS-06/VS-56), and warranty/protection (links to VS-53.3) as attach opportunities
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / In-Store Services
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Per category</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3835_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3835_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3835_Task6" name="Sales Enablement publish and update playbooks (links to W3839), brief store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement publish and update playbooks (links to W3839), brief store teams on new attachments/promotions (links to VS-14/VS-63 store comms), and track attach performance (links to W3849)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3835_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3835_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3835_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3835_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3835_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-601 (ensure controlled execution — Sales Enablement Strategy, Content &amp; Coaching Framework (PA-124.1).) | - operational: attach playbooks; operational: update cycle
Owner: Sales Enablement / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
