    <bpmn:process id="W_W3836" name="W3836. Sales Coaching, Field Enablement &amp; Store-Level Reinforcement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Coaching cadence; performance review
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~200 stores, ~5,800 frontline staff
Owner: Sales Enablement / Store Ops
Participants: Sales Enablement, Store Ops/Regional (links to VS-07), Store Managers, Department Supervisors, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), HR (links to VS-103), Mystery Shopping (links to VS-44/W3850)
Source: workflow W3836 — Sales Coaching, Field Enablement &amp; Store-Level Reinforcement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3836_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3836_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3836_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3836_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3836_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3836_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3836_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3836_Start3" name="Coaching cadence; performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3836_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3836_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Store-Ops establish the coaching operating model…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Store-Ops establish the coaching operating model: store-manager and department-supervisor as front-line coaches, regional/field enablement support, coaching cadence (pre-shift huddles, weekly coaching, monthly review), and coaching tools (observation checklists, call/coaching logs)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3836_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3836_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3836_Task5" name="Sales Enablement train store managers/supervisors as coaches (coach-the-coach)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement train store managers/supervisors as coaches (coach-the-coach), equip them with the playbooks (links to W3834/W3835) and observation tools, and reinforce selling behaviors on the floor (greeting, needs-discovery, attach, loyalty enrollment, clienteling links to W3844)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / L&amp;D / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3836_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3836_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3836_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Store-Ops monitor selling quality via observation, mystery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Store-Ops monitor selling quality via observation, mystery shopping (links to VS-44/W3850), and customer feedback (links to VS-13/W1550), and feed coaching priorities and recognition (links to W3838)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Store Ops / Insights
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3836_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3836_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3836_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3836_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
