        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-601 (ensure controlled execution — Sales Enablement Strategy, Content &amp; Coaching Framework (PA-124.1).) | - operational: coach-the-coach and tools; operational: coaching cadence and field support
Owner: Sales Enablement / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
