    <bpmn:process id="W_W3837" name="W3837. Trade-Pro / B2B Consultative Selling Enablement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B strategy (links to VS-11/VS-107); trade-pro program (links to VS-43)
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Trade/B2B selling enablement
Owner: Sales Enablement / Trade Sales
Participants: Sales Enablement, Trade/B2B Sales (links to VS-11/VS-107), Trade Pro Program (links to VS-43), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Key Account (links to VS-107), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Project/Design (links to VS-66)
Source: workflow W3837 — Trade-Pro / B2B Consultative Selling Enablement</bpmn:documentation>
