      <bpmn:userTask id="W3837_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Trade-Sales develop trade-pro/B2B consultative selling…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Trade-Sales develop trade-pro/B2B consultative selling enablement: understanding trade-pro job economics, project/quotation selling (links to VS-11.2/VS-66.2), account and contract pricing (links to VS-11.1/W163), volume and project baskets, and trade-pro loyalty/value props (links to VS-43) — distinct from B2C selling
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Trade Sales / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead / Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3837_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3837_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3837_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Key-Account enable key-account/enterprise selling (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Key-Account enable key-account/enterprise selling (links to VS-107): account-team selling, executive engagement, solution/program selling, and bid/tender response (links to VS-46 for B2G)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Key Account
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3837_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3837_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3837_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/L&amp;D deliver trade-pro/B2B selling certification and coaching…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/L&amp;D deliver trade-pro/B2B selling certification and coaching for Pro-Desk/trade-focused associates and account teams, and track trade-pro capture and account growth (links to W3849/VS-107)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / L&amp;D / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3837_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3837_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
