    <bpmn:process id="W_W3838" name="W3838. Sales Contest, Incentive &amp; Motivation Program Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Commercial cycle; incentive review
Frequency: Per campaign + annual
Volume: Enterprise sales-incentive program
Owner: Sales Enablement / HR / Finance
Participants: Sales Enablement, HR/Compensation (links to VS-102), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Marketing (links to VS-14), Payroll (links to VS-19.2), Recognition (links to W630)
Source: workflow W3838 — Sales Contest, Incentive &amp; Motivation Program Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3838_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3838_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
