        <bpmn:outgoing>W3838_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3838_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/HR/Finance design sales contests and incentives aligned to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/HR/Finance design sales contests and incentives aligned to commercial priorities (attach, basket size, trade-pro capture, category push, slow-mover clearance links to VS-64), with equitable access across stores/roles, lawful and within budget (links to VS-102/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / HR / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3838_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3838_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3838_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Marketing launch and communicate contests (store comms links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Marketing launch and communicate contests (store comms links to VS-63, recognition links to W630), track leaderboards transparently, and sustain motivation
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Marketing / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3838_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3838_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3838_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Payroll administer incentive payout (links to VS-19.2/W1001…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Payroll administer incentive payout (links to VS-19.2/W1001 profit-sharing where applicable), measure contest ROI (sales lift vs incentive cost — links to W3849), and iterate the incentive design
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Finance / Payroll
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3838_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3838_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3838_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3838_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
