    <bpmn:process id="W_W3839" name="W3839. Sales Enablement Technology &amp; Content Delivery Platform" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tech cycle; content need
Frequency: Maintained + continuous
Volume: Enablement tech stack (LMS, mobile, clienteling tool)
Owner: Sales Enablement / IT
Participants: Sales Enablement, IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), Enterprise Architecture (links to VS-113), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3839 — Sales Enablement Technology &amp; Content Delivery Platform</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3839_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3839_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
