      <bpmn:userTask id="W3839_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/IT/EA manage the enablement technology stack: mobile-first…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/IT/EA manage the enablement technology stack: mobile-first content/product-info access for associates on the floor (links to VS-75 employee app), micro-learning and refreshers via OLA (links to VS-19.4), clienteling tool (links to W3844), and quick-reference/playbook access — aligned to enterprise architecture (links to VS-113)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / IT / EA
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead / CIO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3839_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3839_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3839_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/IT deliver and update content (playbooks links to W3834/W3835…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/IT deliver and update content (playbooks links to W3834/W3835, product knowledge links to W3842, promotions links to VS-14/VS-63) to the floor in near-real-time, and ensure offline-capable access in stores
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / IT / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3839_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3839_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3839_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics measure content adoption and effectiveness (views…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics measure content adoption and effectiveness (views, completion, knowledge-check pass rates, correlation to selling KPIs — links to W3849) and prioritize content
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3839_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3839_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
