    <bpmn:process id="W_W3840" name="W3840. Sales Enablement Budget, Vendor/Partner Governance &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); vendor cycle; review
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Enablement budget &amp; vendor portfolio
Owner: Sales Enablement / Finance
Participants: Sales Enablement, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Procurement (links to VS-34), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Merchandising (links to VS-01), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), ABC (links to VS-86.3)
Source: workflow W3840 — Sales Enablement Budget, Vendor/Partner Governance &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3840_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3840_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3840_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3840_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3840_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3840_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3840_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3840_Start3" name="Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); vendor cycle; review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3840_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3840_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Finance develop the enablement budget: content production…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Finance develop the enablement budget: content production, coaching/field team, technology (links to W3839), contests/incentives (links to W3838), and vendor-funded enablement; align to annual budget (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3840_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3840_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3840_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Procurement/Legal govern enablement vendors/partners (training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Procurement/Legal govern enablement vendors/partners (training providers, content, mystery-shopping links to VS-44), vendor-funded enablement (compliant with ABC links to VS-86.3 and brand-neutrality), and contracts/SLAs (links to W688/VS-100.3)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Per vendor + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3840_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3840_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3840_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics run continuous improvement: measure enablement ROI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Analytics run continuous improvement: measure enablement ROI (links to W3849), gather store/associate feedback, and reallocate budget to highest-impact enablement
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3840_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3840_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3840_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3840_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3840_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-601 (ensure controlled execution — Sales Enablement Strategy, Content &amp; Coaching Framework (PA-124.1).) | - operational: ROI analytics; operational: ABC and brand-neutrality
Owner: Sales Enablement / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
